  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】越後湯沢といえばコレ！ぽんしゅ館利き酒・南魚沼コシヒカリ・へぎそば＆新幹線駅近名宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-sky-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🍶 新幹線駅直結「ぽんしゅ館」の利き酒と本場南魚沼コシヒカリ！川端康成『雪国』の名湯</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">東京駅から上越新幹線で最速70分。駅構内で新潟全蔵の銘酒をコインで味わえる「ぽんしゅ館（唎酒番所）」、日本一の米どころ「南魚沼産コシヒカリ」の炊きたてご飯、布海苔をつなぎに使った喉越し抜群の「へぎそば」。駅から徒歩3分で庭園露天風呂に浸かれる贅沢な温泉旅が叶います。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 越後湯沢を代表する最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38764/38764.jpg\" alt=\"越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 越後湯沢駅東口徒歩3分！四季の庭園露天風呂「季里の湯」＆地酒BARと魚沼コシヒカリ会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">越後湯沢駅すぐの圧倒的アクセス。岩風呂や泡風呂など多彩な大浴場、新潟の銘酒が揃うラウンジバー、魚沼の旬食材バイキングが絶賛。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>新幹線旅行派、ご夫婦、シニア、駅近で名湯と地酒を満喫したい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>新幹線駅徒歩3分の最強立地と極上魚沼会席なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D38764\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">越後湯沢温泉　ＮＡＳＰＡニューオータニ</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.46</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/6011/6011.jpg\" alt=\"越後湯沢温泉　ＮＡＳＰＡニューオータニ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 250坪のメガ大浴場露天風呂＆ニューオータニ伝統の美食！スキー場直結リゾート</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">越後湯沢駅より無料送迎シャトル3分。天然温泉大浴場や屋内プール、ホテルニューオータニの伝統を受け継ぐフレンチ・和食が至高。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、三世代、カップル、高級ホテルのおもてなしを求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>メガ大浴場とニューオータニクオリティの美食ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D6011\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】越後湯沢温泉　ＮＡＳＰＡニューオータニ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
